# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for lasm (TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tests/tsan.supp).
#
# moodycamel::ConcurrentQueue, implicit producers: a dequeuer reads a slot,
# then marks it empty with a release-only fetch_add on the block's
# elementsCompletelyDequeued counter; the dequeuer that empties the block
# returns it to the free list, and a producer that takes the block from the
# free list writes the slot again. The counter RMW is not an acquire, so in
# the C++ model the first dequeuer's read does not happen-before the reuse,
# and TSan reports the slot write (enqueue) against the earlier slot read
# (dequeue). The RMW chain orders them on x86 and ARMv8; the queue is
# third-party code. Seen in print_dbg_seqs (--print-bi-dbg).
race:moodycamel::ConcurrentQueue<*>::ImplicitProducer::enqueue<*>
